scope: "The sensor-neutral fingerprint identity layer: the eight entities and the match chain; the de-vendoring seam; the two storage tiers (an unbounded fingerprint_storage library and a working set that is the game's cast); template-set identity by uuid and completeness by count, with no hashing anywhere; the two outcome vocabularies and the designed deception; the upstream messages and their device address; enrollment as a ceremony that harvests into the library; the editor and station boundaries; and retention."
audience: "The author of the fingerprint_storage service; the author of the enrollment station and editor; the architect ruling the open decisions; the game designer casting a module."
